        "original_id": "6485b084-fc07-5b6f-be5f-1135e0931895",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Bruce, Peter Koper, Taylor Nichols, Biff Yeager, Evan Ross, Leven Rambin, Harold Perrineau\n- Works: Headless Body in Topless Bar, Case 219, Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, Damsels in Distress, Black Samurai, Repo Man, Prime Risk, Girls Just Want to Have Fun, Savage Dawn, Sid and Nancy, Straight to Hell, Walker, Banzai Runner, Edward Scissorhands, Another You, Best Men, White Oleander, Paris\n- Topics: film credits, film roles\n\nFacts:\n- Biff Yeager appeared in the films \"Black Samurai\" in 1977, \"Repo Man\" in 1984, and \"Prime Risk,\" \"Girls Just Want to Have Fun,\" and \"Savage Dawn\" in 1985.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in the films \"Sid and Nancy\" in 1986 and \"Straight to Hell,\" \"Walker,\" and \"Banzai Runner\" in 1987.\n- Edward Scissorhands was released in 1990, and Biff Yeager appeared in it.\n- Another You was released in 1991, and Biff Yeager appeared in it.\n- Headless Body in Topless Bar is a 1995 American black comedy and psychological horror film directed by James Bruce and written by Peter Koper.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in \"Headless Body in Topless Bar\" in 1995 and in \"Best Men\" in 1997.\n- White Oleander was released in 2002 and Paris was released in 2003, and Biff Yeager appeared in both films.\n- Taylor Nichols was born on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky, and he is an American actor.\n- Taylor Nichols is best known for roles in the Whit Stillman films \"Metropolitan,\" \"Barcelona,\" \"The Last Days of Disco,\" and \"Damsels in Distress.\"\n- Case 219 is a 2010 American drama film starring Evan Ross, Leven Rambin, Taylor Nichols, and Harold Perrineau.",
